DECLARE `s 726(4) transaction` IS ONE OF
    `s 726(4)(a) an allotment of shares as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares`
    `s 726(4)(b) the payment of an amount payable on the redemption of the treasury shares`
    `s 726(4) any other transaction`

-- src:9543 | (4) Nothing in this section prevents—
-- src:9544 | (a) an allotment of shares as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares, or
-- src:9545 | (b) the payment of any amount payable on the redemption of the treasury shares (if they are redeemable shares).
@ref s 726(4) Nothing in this section prevents a bonus allotment or the payment on redemption of redeemable treasury shares (src:9543-9545)
GIVEN `s 726(1) this section applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      transaction IS A `s 726(4) transaction`
      `the treasury shares are redeemable shares` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 726(4) section 726 prevents the transaction` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 726(1) this section applies`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
         CONSIDER transaction
         WHEN `s 726(4)(a) an allotment of shares as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section prevents— (a) an allotment of shares as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares"
         WHEN `s 726(4)(b) the payment of an amount payable on the redemption of the treasury shares` THEN
              IF `the treasury shares are redeemable shares`
              THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section prevents— ... (b) the payment of any amount payable on the redemption of the treasury shares (if they are redeemable shares)"
              ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(if they are redeemable shares)"
         WHEN `s 726(4) any other transaction` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the list of what the section does not prevent is not closed
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "This section applies where shares are held by a company as treasury shares"

-- src:9546 | (5) Shares allotted as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares are treated as if purchased by the company, at the time they were allotted, in circumstances in which section 724(1) (treasury shares) applied.
@ref s 726(5) Shares allotted as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares are treated as purchased in circumstances in which section 724(1) applied (src:9546-9546)
GIVEN `the shares are allotted as fully paid bonus shares in respect of treasury shares` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 726(5) the shares are treated as purchased by the company, at the time they were allotted, in circumstances in which section 724(1) applied` MEANS
    IF `the shares are allotted as fully paid bonus shares in respect of treasury shares`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Shares allotted as fully paid bonus shares in respect of the treasury shares"

