    IF `the date on which the company delivered the return to the registrar` AT LEAST `the date on which the shares were disposed of`
       AND `the date on which the company delivered the return to the registrar` AT MOST (`s 728(1) the last day for delivering the return to the registrar` `the date on which the shares were disposed of`)
