    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the company must deliver a return to the registrar not later than 28 days after the shares are disposed of"

@ref s 728(1) Where treasury shares are sold or transferred for an employees' share scheme, the company must deliver a return to the registrar not later than 28 days after the shares are disposed of (src:9562-9565)
